alse,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-07-29T10:21:46","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"456a9d9e-fdee-4969-abb2-ac6e382e9edd","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":390848740,"PostDateInt":1784881454000,"PostDate":"2026-07-24T16:24:14","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"华东医疗健康行业解决方案专家（SaaS CRM）(J11742)","OrgId":700408702,"Org":"医疗健康部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"纷享销客正在招募医疗健康行业解决方案专家，聚焦医疗设备、IVD、医用耗材、生物技术等细分行业，负责行业解决方案建设、重点客户售前支持及复杂项目突破，推动公司在医疗健康行业的业务增长与标杆复制。\n\n1、深入洞察医疗设备、IVD、耗材、生物技术行业客户需求，制定行业拓展策略。\n2、围绕销售管理、渠道协同、终端覆盖、学术推广、客户经营、售后服务等场景，打造行业化CRM解决方案。\n3、支持销售推进重点客户、大客户及复杂项目，包括需求调研、方案交流、POC、投标及项目赢单。\n4、参与客户高层沟通，输出有业务价值的数字化转型建议。\n5、联动产品、交付、客户成功团队，沉淀行业最佳实践、标杆案例和标准化方案。\n6、赋能售前及相关团队，提升公司在医疗健康行业的专业能力和市场影响力。","Require":"1、8年以上To B软件、SaaS、数字化解决方案或咨询经验。\n2、熟悉医疗设备、IVD、耗材、生物技术等一个或多个细分行业。\n3、有CRM/SFA/渠道管理/客户经营等相关经验，具备成熟售前咨询能力。\n4、有中大型客户或复杂项目推进经验，擅长需求挖掘、方案设计和大项目运作。\n5、具备较强的行业洞察、跨部门协同、沟通表达和结果达成能力。\n6、有SaaS CRM厂商、企业软件厂商、咨询公司背景者优先